{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the Animal Planet, cats and dogs are competing for a shared playground where their packs can run and play freely. But instead of fighting, they\u2019ve agreed to settle the dispute through a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most people are familiar with tic-tac-toe \u2014 also known as noughts and crosses \u2014 but it often ends in a draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our reimagined version of tic-tac-toe, there\u2019s always a winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After players take turns placing three cards each, if the game hasn\u2019t been decided, it enters a second phase: <strong>the repositioning round</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, by moving their cards one by one, players must rethink their strategy, anticipate their opponent\u2019s moves, and outmaneuver them \u2014 until a victor emerges.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913060?t=1756735581","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913060?t=1756735581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913060/0dbf067b96a689b92f02fe9e01c6d09af825ce19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756735581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913060/0dbf067b96a689b92f02fe9e01c6d09af825ce19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756735581","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the Animal Planet, cats and dogs are competing for a shared playground where their packs can run and play freely. But instead of fighting, they\u2019ve agreed to settle the dispute through a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most people are familiar with tic-tac-toe \u2014 also known as noughts and crosses \u2014 but it often ends in a draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our reimagined version of tic-tac-toe, there\u2019s always a winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After players take turns placing three cards each, if the game hasn\u2019t been decided, it enters a second phase: <strong>the repositioning round</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, by moving their cards one by one, players must rethink their strategy, anticipate their opponent\u2019s moves, and outmaneuver them \u2014 until a victor emerges.</p>","developers":["Longoza Game Stuio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913060/1bc405d7c180c602e129d32fb09b4c00c0ac62dd/header.jpg?t=1756735581","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3913060/275509522/4d2e50d338b19d8851e262c5a54a655fd1116b26/1756735009/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756735580","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3913060/275509522/4d2e50d338b19d8851e262c5a54a655fd1116b26/1756735009/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756735580","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3913060/275509522/4d2e5